Add a cargo-fuzz target `ndjson` (upstream has none)

A lean4export NDJSON stream checked as the arena runs `kiota --use-stdin`:
Parser::run reads the export from memory line by line and checks each
declaration as it is encountered, on the calling thread (the CLI uses a
1 GiB-stack worker thread). Reject/Decline/Other results are verdicts;
panics are findings.
Upstream: none (no fuzz targets upstream, checked 2026-11-22).

